  "rawHtml": "<div style=\"font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif;background:#fbfaf7;padding:6px 0;\">\n  <div style=\"font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:#0a0a0a;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:2px;\">記者　LI Z.</div>\n  <p style=\"font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.85;color:#1a1a1a;margin:0 0 14px;\">那你怎么看\"乡愁\"这两个字？</p>\n  <div style=\"font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:#0a0a0a;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:2px;\">受訪　Y. W.</div>\n  <p style=\"font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.85;color:#1a1a1a;margin:0;\">乡愁是地理被时间替换之后的产物。我们怀念的从来不是地方，而是再也回不去的那个自己。</p>\n</div>"
